  "problem": "Which of the following shows a right angle?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/e6ee9f2a0b7dfa70c1d61dac0d19e1347d56ba94d93762c435d0727216d61143.png)",
  "worked_solution": "An angle of $90^\\circ$ has the same measure as one-quarter of a full turn.\n\nAmong the given options, the only $90^\\circ$ angle is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/b2e63cd5919753a0b549f345ecfa5dbfa40bf5d85a3dbe8b59872119316d1dd7.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is II.",
